import LOEIS.A100.A100035.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A100035

a(n+1) occurs not earlier as a neighbor of terms = a(n): either it is the greatest number < a(n) or, if no such number exists, the smallest number > a(n); a(1) = 1.

The 88 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A100035

